Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Statues Catch the Red-Ring Rabbit
- Story & Context: Outside the grand canopy of the wedding tent, rival aerialists challenged each other to a game of frozen-tag across the high-wire cables while the sound system roared its first true Calliope-House hybrid rhythm. Young Leo Vane broke three bones when the steam-bass dropped, yet he kept dancing on one leg in the mud while the crowds threw glowing confetti. The track records the precise moment the feuding families stopped swinging fists and started locked-arm partner spins. "We dance on the wire until the wooden rabbit breaks!" sang the choir as the keys spiraled upward into history.
